{"id":"vod_sn_39154","vodId":"39154","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"无口的森田小姐第一季","name_cn":"无口的森田小姐第一季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/298a7ac491e4ee28da4683d7dc1fc698.jpg"},"summary":"在同学的眼中，森田真由（花泽香菜 配音）是一个沉默寡言的神秘女生。其实，真由的个性并非如此，母亲森田由美（七瀬亜深 配音）的教导影响了她的性格，导致真由每一次想要说话的时候，都在脑中进行着信息量巨大的深思熟虑，而正是这样的思考，另真由错过了最佳的应答时机，久而久之，落下了无口女的称号。　　但是，这样的真由并不寂寞，率真坦诚的村越美树（戸松遥 配音），知识量充沛的三浦千寻（早见沙织 配音），单纯野性的松坂花（南条爱乃 配音），学习和运动皆是万能的山本（平贺三恵 配音），在这些同学的陪伴下，真由的学校生活常常充斥着数不尽的惊喜和笑料。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DDGpn4K7jf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iyTUCHq0fM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BRSShXQXzf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5MBuRpu18Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hpu0iJ3Mtf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tKweixqmdd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P8Sy5Bxbyx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/87CkRvBtJJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yjjeErQd841/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qC18HUH3z41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fH2X9vTVHV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ep0pFvwe7z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RkhkBCZhjV1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:49.880Z"}